# RESCITE — files excluded from version control.
# Goal: anything sensitive or regenerable stays out of the repo.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sensitive / private source material (NOT shipped to the live site)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# aboutme.txt contains credential IDs (PTCB license #, ITIL cert #)
# and other personal-life detail. Keep on disk only.
_source/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sencha Cmd build & dev artifacts (regenerated by `sencha app build`
# and `sencha app watch` — no value in source control)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
rescite/build/
rescite/bootstrap.js
rescite/bootstrap.css
rescite/bootstrap.json
rescite/bootstrap.jsonp
rescite/.sencha/app/temp/
rescite/.sencha/workspace/temp/
rescite/packages/local/rescite-theme/build/

# Sencha Cmd error logs
**/sencha-error-*.log

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored framework
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sencha Cmd copies the entire Ext JS framework into rescite/ext/ on
# `sencha generate app`. ~200MB+ of upstream files we did not author.
# A fresh checkout can re-install it via `sencha framework upgrade`
# or `sencha generate app`.
rescite/ext/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / IDE / OS noise
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
*.log
screenshots/
.cache/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
docs/resources/images/oscar-headhot-new.png
